      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is hashing done in Soong instead of Soong generating a Ninja action to hash the inputs? \n\nThis has a couple of major downsides:\n\n1) incremental builds will be incorrect. Ninja is the only incrementality mechanism in the whole build, so Soong cannot invalidate itself and generate a new hash when the artifact changes.\n2) doing compute for every app/apex module for every build, not just the ones users are interested in. I was expecting something like `m app1-provenance apex1-provenance` so that Ninja would be able to figure out the minimal set of actions.",
